 They will commit acts of bravery and insidious crimes in the name of the other so that the thiet becomes a hero, while the commander turns into a violent outlaw. The only thing they have in common is a tragic, painful love for the same woman. For ten years they will each encounter death and destruction before fate brings them together once more. There will be two of them again - strong and courageous, ready to fight for their love.. with the knowledge that retribution awaits them.","language":"en-US"},"tagline":{"value":"Another name. Another love. Another life.","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"2013-10-27","endDate":"2013-10-31","status":"Ended","rating":5.8,"ratingCount":13,"numberOfEpisodes":10,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["War & Politics","Dramma"],"countries":["Russia"],"facts":{"Runtime":"46m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":412,"name":"Russia-1","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t96cnWLH1OivW91EXygZDNSmhAK.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":86151,"name":"Vladimir Mashkov","role":"Igor Anatolievich Petrov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmahacE9YLCWQOGxmIb3f9QHK7D.jpg"},{"id":116005,"name":"Evgeny Mironov","role":"Arseny Nikolayevich Skvortsov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqqeU0klzTydRe4JeSeSPjwCk27.jpg"},{"id":1067188,"name":"Elena Lyadova","role":"Rita (Igor's wife)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9V0PL1cQ2tO8R4FwT0rOkIxAEMQ.jpg"},{"id":81000,"name":"Sergey Garmash","role":"Major Zakhar Ignatievich Kupriyanov (MIA investigator)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y2AntlTrbLQUSWZ4RjuUxkvD241.jpg"},{"id":4793,"name":"Chulpan Khamatova","role":"Sonya (Restaurant singer)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97LVWafPRjyBHJLKdqBHN9dwmEF.jpg"},{"id":587910,"name":"Andrey Smolyakov","role":"Vitya \"Сloakroom\" (Criminal leader)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AcuDKPIUa6xD3LYGqDr7gqEj3o9.jpg"},{"id":86637,"name":"Pyotr Mamonov","role":"\"Grandfather Leuva\" (Prof